Package: ooansi
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Description: SGR ESCAPES
 Applies and strips Select Graphic Rendition (SGR) escape codes from text.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 oote theme palettes, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
